{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bThis game is currently under development. All visuals are subject to adjustment. Please look forward to the final quality!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**\u3010<strong>Game Overview</strong>\u3011**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a genius engineer, find yourself living together with a Landmine Girl by chance. This lively and adorable girl quickly captures your attention. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your feelings grow, you become lovers, but soon realize that her love is heavy, even obsessive, like a mine ready to explode at any moment! Can you defuse the landmines in her heart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a landmine-style romance filled with intense emotional manipulation and obsessive attachment. Some players may find the content distressing. Please proceed with caution\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/347a206e2d922b9a8fa7a18c3f2c3348.avif?t=1755281710\" width=370 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>**\u3010Game System\u3011**</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---Classic Minesweeper Mini-Game---</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a top-notch engineer, it makes perfect sense to put your &quot;mine sweeping&quot; skills to use anywhere you can. Whether it's coding work, cracking social media passwords, or even dating a Landmine Girl. Wherever there are mines, I'll sweep them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/4b0bbeb3a2a98fd1d43363a81c57b6af.poster.avif?t=1755281710\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/4b0bbeb3a2a98fd1d43363a81c57b6af.webm?t=1755281710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/4b0bbeb3a2a98fd1d43363a81c57b6af.mp4?t=1755281710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---Social Media Snooping for Intel---</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathering &quot;intel&quot; is key to winning a girl\u2019s heart. Spy on her social media accounts to glimpse her past, relationships, and daily life, and use that knowledge to push your romance forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/d535379b18055549316ec408b7114fa5.avif?t=1755281710\" width=370 height=514 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---Heart-Throbbing Co-Living---</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making her smile is essential. Chat, give her gifts, go on dates, and send her messages to raise her affection, unlocking more intimate moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/96d7a2b3082bc8a6b7cac6e526f43673.poster.avif?t=1755281710\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/96d7a2b3082bc8a6b7cac6e526f43673.webm?t=1755281710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/96d7a2b3082bc8a6b7cac6e526f43673.mp4?t=1755281710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/34177515f154910f446b68d94d0af89e.poster.avif?t=1755281710\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/34177515f154910f446b68d94d0af89e.webm?t=1755281710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/34177515f154910f446b68d94d0af89e.mp4?t=1755281710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>**\u3010Character Introduction\u3011**</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landmine Girl - Xinmei</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/extras/8d1c333d6c9fe59cd6ad8304bdbd830b.avif?t=1755281710\" width=400 height=515 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;I think I... might like you... Just kidding!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sweet and adorable Landmine Girl, Xinmei, has a knack for capturing men's hearts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no one to rely on, she resorts to \u2764various special means\u2764 to make ends meet, demonstrating an exceptional talent for earning money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you spend more time with her, you begin to discover the many secrets she keeps hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you defuse the mines in her heart?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3385320?t=1755281710","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/be43171fa4ff769c8423a551f36b9583a78cb636/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755281710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385320/bce7d231f39e90b104cec8f727b893d0d9ec4ad5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755281710","capsule_ima